  m_text: "1. Pocket all your balls first, then the black 8-ball to win.\r\n2. Always
    hit your own balls first, not your opponent\u2019s\r\n3. If you miss or foul,
    other player gets the white ball (Ball in Hand).\r\n4. Don\u2019t pocket the
    8-ball early, that\u2019s game over!\r\n5. The winner will be awarded an amount
    equal to double the stake, subject to a 10% deduction as a processing fee, with
    the remaining balance then considered the official final payout amount.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
